# Config for the Auditor's approval-check over rh/agents, read by audit-approvals.
# Assembled to /opt/agent/approval-check-agents.env, root owned and read only, so the
# running agent cannot edit the approver list. Shell sourceable (KEY=value).
#
# GM_KEY is cos-rh, the author of rh/agents commits: a yes must sit in a thread it
# posted in. APPROVAL_CHANNELS are the channels where cos-rh's yeses are given (#staff,
# #pulpbot-bench). These are the same values cos-rh itself uses. A change to any value
# here needs an approver's yes, same as any other principal change.
APPROVER_KEYS=763c87084f3b5afb6c422411601d135c57545bdc14a8d46499c1130c1b5735c1,e5abab3a573180128c205fd9b7764511c81ee641b8594e6c7acbb2f90631a0a4
GM_KEY=6a14bf7b3d7259f77e5b40a4817a084b11002f54e585eda431c4befa5d150c0d
